{"2389830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "閃攻機人アスラ - ASURA THE STRIKER -", "steam_appid": 2389830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [3681130], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 About ASURA THE STRIKER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASURA THE STRIKER is a high-speed 3D rail shooter inspired by the legendary arcade shooters of the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the humanoid combat weapon &quot;ASURA&quot; and intercept waves of invaders descending from space. Experience explosive action, relentless speed, and intense battles against overwhelming enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Shot</strong> – Your primary ranged attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shining Knuckle</strong> – Charge power and unleash a devastating close-range punch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Over Drive</strong> – Slow down time to evade impossible attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master these three abilities and fight your way through massive enemy formations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Signature Actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through swarms of invaders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.poster.avif?t=1776975205\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.webm?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.mp4?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through massive enemy formations as the battlefield unfolds at blazing speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape danger with Lightning Over Drive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.poster.avif?t=1776975205\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.webm?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.mp4?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate the special ability &quot;Lightning Over Drive&quot; to slow down time and slip through dense enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush powerful foes with Shining Knuckle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.poster.avif?t=1776975205\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.webm?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.mp4?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your energy and unleash the devastating attack &quot;Shining Knuckle&quot; to smash powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying invader bosses await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.poster.avif?t=1776975205\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.webm?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.mp4?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each stage, powerful invader bosses stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ Basic Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Left Stick / D-Pad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Shot</strong>: Press to fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shining Knuckle</strong>: Hold the punch button → Release to unleash a powerful punch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Over Drive</strong>: Press the slow button to activate time slowdown (consumes gauge)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When releasing the stick, you can choose whether ASURA returns to the center or remains in place via the options menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 About the Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LeftOver</strong> is an indie development brand formed by two creators. Nearly every aspect of the game — planning, programming, design, and sound — is handled by the two of us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development may take time, but we are committed to delivering the best possible arcade-style experience. Thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚠️ Performance Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When using monitors with refresh rates higher than 60Hz, the game speed may behave unexpectedly. If this occurs, please disable vSync in the in-game options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OPTION → vSync → Off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Reducing Rendering Load</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The OPTION menu includes a &quot;Render Resolution&quot; setting. Lowering this value reduces rendering load in exchange for image quality. Please use this option if the game runs slowly.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🚀 About ASURA THE STRIKER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASURA THE STRIKER is a high-speed 3D rail shooter inspired by the legendary arcade shooters of the 80s and 90s.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the humanoid combat weapon &quot;ASURA&quot; and intercept waves of invaders descending from space. Experience explosive action, relentless speed, and intense battles against overwhelming enemy forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Shot</strong> – Your primary ranged attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shining Knuckle</strong> – Charge power and unleash a devastating close-range punch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Over Drive</strong> – Slow down time to evade impossible attacks</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master these three abilities and fight your way through massive enemy formations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎮 Signature Actions</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through swarms of invaders!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.poster.avif?t=1776975205\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.webm?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/0588d2ee7c9fcf91ee13d34199e96d3f.mp4?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through massive enemy formations as the battlefield unfolds at blazing speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape danger with Lightning Over Drive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.poster.avif?t=1776975205\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.webm?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/c83bf3c62eb91e4c1f8750fff75011fd.mp4?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Activate the special ability &quot;Lightning Over Drive&quot; to slow down time and slip through dense enemy attacks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crush powerful foes with Shining Knuckle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.poster.avif?t=1776975205\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.webm?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/99fd9409ee56de44848427813c0374ac.mp4?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your energy and unleash the devastating attack &quot;Shining Knuckle&quot; to smash powerful enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrifying invader bosses await!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.poster.avif?t=1776975205\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.webm?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2389830/extras/67223bb8bdab139f8acf3ecd61d72402.mp4?t=1776975205\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of each stage, powerful invader bosses stand in your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🕹️ Basic Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Movement</strong>: Left Stick / D-Pad</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy Shot</strong>: Press to fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shining Knuckle</strong>: Hold the punch button → Release to unleash a powerful punch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lightning Over Drive</strong>: Press the slow button to activate time slowdown (consumes gauge)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When releasing the stick, you can choose whether ASURA returns to the center or remains in place via the options menu.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧪 About the Developers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LeftOver</strong> is an indie development brand formed by two creators. Nearly every aspect of the game — planning, programming, design, and sound — is handled by the two of us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Development may take time, but we are committed to delivering the best possible arcade-style experience. Thank you for your support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚠️ Performance Notice</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When using monitors with refresh rates higher than 60Hz, the game speed may behave unexpectedly. If this occurs, please disable vSync in the in-game options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OPTION → vSync → Off</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ Reducing Rendering Load</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The OPTION menu includes a &quot;Render Resolution&quot; setting. Lowering this value reduces rendering load in exchange for image quality. Please use this option if the game runs slowly.</p>", "short_description": "A high-speed 3D rail shooter inspired by legendary arcade classics. Control the humanoid combat weapon ASURA and battle overwhelming waves of invaders using Energy Shot, Shining Knuckle, and the time-bending Lightning Over Drive.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simp